Write your own @code{encode_symbol}, a function that returns the
bits that encode a given symbol according to a given tree.  You should
design @code{encode_symbol} so that it returns a @code{SchemeError} if the symbol is not in
the tree at all.  Test your procedure by encoding the result you obtained in
